      "text": "MASTER SERVICES AGREEMENT This Master Services Agreement (\u201cAgreement\u201d) is entered into as of April 1, 2026 (the \u201cEffective Date\u201d) by and between Harborline Analytics, Inc., a Delaware corporation (\u201cProvider\u201d), and Meridian Health Systems LLC, an Oregon limited liability company (\u201cClient\u201d). 1.Term This Agreement shall commence on the Effective Date and shall continue for an initial term of 24 months, unless earlier terminated in accordance with Section 4. 2. Fees Client shall pay Provider a total contract value of $186,000.00, invoiced quarterly in equal installments, for the services described in Exhibit A. 3. Governing Law This Agreement shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the State of Delaware, without regard to its conflict of laws principles. 4. Termination Either party may terminate this Agreement for convenience upon sixty (60) days\u2019 prior written notice to the other party.",
